// Post-compromise hunt: did anything change on the host?
// 4720 user created | 4732 member added to local group
// 4698 scheduled task created | 1102 security log cleared
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where EventID in (4720, 4732, 4698, 1102)
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, Activity, Account, TargetUserName, SubjectUserName
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
